{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_04876","headline":"春夜寓直凤阁怀羣公 · 魏知古","name":"春夜寓直凤阁怀羣公","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"拜门传漏晚，寓直索居时。\n昔重安仁赋，今称伯玉诗。\n鸳池满不溢，鸡树久逾滋。\n夙夜怀山甫，清风咏所思。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"魏知古","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_04876.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_04876","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}